# [[.Title]]

A Steward provider for [[.Title]], built with [`@treno-dev/steward-sdk`](https://github.com/treno-dev/steward-sdk/tree/main/js).

## Run

```sh
npm install
steward provider validate node src/provider.ts
```

Node runs `src/provider.ts` directly. A provider is started by a runner, not by hand: run directly it says so
and exits. Use `steward provider validate` to check it, and
`steward provider run --context context.json node src/provider.ts` to invoke it. Write logs to standard error.

Run `npm run check` to type-check.

## Test

Save this as `context.json`, the credential and units to call the provider with:

```json
{
  "credential": {
    "inputs": { "base_url": "https://example.test" },
    "secrets": { "API_TOKEN": "secret" }
  },
  "identity": { "external_id": "someone@example.test" },
  "role": { "name": "viewer", "permissions": [{ "name": "view" }] },
  "units": [{ "kind": "item", "name": "demo", "inputs": { "description": "A demo item" } }]
}
```

```sh
steward provider run --context context.json node src/provider.ts
steward provider run --context context.json --call provision node src/provider.ts
```

The first creates each unit, grants and revokes the role, and removes it. It does this for real, in
whatever your secrets reach, and asks before it starts (`--yes` skips the question). `--call` makes
only the calls you name, once each and without cleaning up: `provision`, `grant-access`, `get-access`,
`revoke-access` and `deprovision`. `steward provider validate` never changes anything.

## Where things are

`src/provider.ts` declares the provider's inputs (what it needs to connect), each kind of unit and the
handlers Steward calls: `provision`, `deprovision`, `grantAccess`, `revokeAccess` and `getAccess`.
Each handler is annotated with the request and response types the SDK exports. Delete the handlers
you do not need: Steward offers only what you implement.

To add a kind of unit, call `provider.unit({ kind, ... })` again with its own inputs, outputs and
handlers.

See the [SDK README](https://github.com/treno-dev/steward-sdk/blob/main/js/README.md) for
everything a provider can declare.
